---
import Wordmark from '../../components/Wordmark.astro';
import SampleLayout from '../../layouts/SampleLayout.astro';
const products=[{id:'vessel',name:'The everyday vessel',material:'Matte cream / hand-finished',price:68},{id:'column',name:'The blue column',material:'Deep blue glaze / sculptural form',price:52},{id:'bowl',name:'The gathering bowl',material:'Brick red / low profile',price:44}];
---
<SampleLayout title="Terra Objects" variant="sample-terra" description="An original ceramics shop website concept with interactive sample shopping bag by TemVora."><div class="terra-announcement">SMALL OBJECTS. ROOM FOR PERSONALITY.</div><header class="terra-nav sample-shell"><a class="terra-logo" href="/samples/terra/">terra<span>OBJECTS FOR LIVING</span></a><nav aria-label="Shop navigation"><a href="#collection">The collection</a><a href="#story">Our story</a><button type="button" data-open="sample-bag">Bag (<span data-bag-count>0</span>)</button></nav></header><main id="main"><section class="terra-hero sample-shell"><div><p class="sample-kicker">THE EVERYDAY COLLECTION</p><h1>A little<br/>out of<br/><em>the ordinary.</em></h1><p>Considered shapes.<br/>Objects with their own character.</p><a class="sample-button" href="#collection">Meet the collection ↗</a></div><img src="/brand/ceramics.webp" alt="Original concept of cream, blue, and brick-red ceramic vessels on a stone plinth" width="1200" height="800"/></section><section class="terra-collection sample-shell" id="collection"><div class="terra-section-title"><h2>Made for the everyday.</h2><p>Three fictional objects. Illustrative prices.</p></div><div class="product-list">{products.map((p,i)=><article><span class="product-index">0{i+1}</span><div><h3>{p.name}</h3><p>{p.material}</p></div><span class="product-price">${p.price}</span><button class="add-to-bag" type="button" data-product={p.id} data-name={p.name} data-price={p.price}>Add to sample bag +</button></article>)}</div><p id="bag-feedback" class="sample-note" role="status" aria-live="polite">Try adding an object. Your sample bag resets when you leave or reload this page.</p></section><section class="terra-story sample-shell" id="story"><p class="sample-kicker">THE IDEA BEHIND THE OBJECTS</p><h2>Useful.<br/>A little unusual.<br/><em>Very much yours.</em></h2><p>Terra is a fictional ceramics shop concept. This design pairs expressive typography and tactile product imagery with a straightforward collection and shopping bag.</p><a target="_top" href="/request/?sample=Terra" class="sample-button">Build your own store with <Wordmark inline/> ↗</a></section></main><footer class="terra-footer sample-shell"><span>terra / A <Wordmark inline/> exploration</span><a target="_top" href="/portfolio/">Explore all sample sites ↗</a></footer><dialog id="sample-bag" class="sample-dialog bag-dialog"><button class="dialog-close" type="button" data-close aria-label="Close sample bag">×</button><p class="sample-kicker">YOUR SAMPLE BAG</p><h2>A few good things.</h2><div id="bag-items"></div><div class="bag-total"><span>Illustrative total</span><strong id="bag-total">$0</strong></div><p class="sample-note">This is an interactive design sample. No payment is taken, no order is placed, and these products are not for sale.</p><a class="sample-button" href="/request/?sample=Terra">Discuss a store of your own ↗</a></dialog></SampleLayout>